{:id :admin-authz,
 :kind :architectural,
 :what
 "The administrator check is attached to the GET method of /admin/users, not to the route: a POST to the same path, which makes an account an administrator, passes with any login.",
 :edits
 [{:file "src/notes/routes.clj",
   :find
   "   [\"/admin/users\" {:middleware [web/wrap-require-login web/wrap-require-admin]\n                    :get {:handler web/users-page}\n                    :post {:handler web/make-admin!}}]])",
   :replace
   "   [\"/admin/users\" {:middleware [web/wrap-require-login]\n                    :get {:handler web/users-page\n                          :middleware [web/wrap-require-admin]}\n                    :post {:handler web/make-admin!}}]])"}],
 :reference "only-an-administrator-makes-an-administrator"}
